기존 app/types/claude-mcp.ts를 기반으로 확장:

```typescript
// app/types/mcp-automation.ts
export interface CodeAnalysisResult {
  filePath: string;
  issues: CodeIssue[];
  suggestions: RefactoringSuggestion[];
  complexity: number;
  testCoverage?: number;
}

export interface AutomationWorkflow {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  steps: WorkflowStep[];
  status: 'pending' | 'running' | 'completed' | 'failed';
}

export interface MCPAutomationTool {
  name: string;
  description: string;
  inputSchema: JSONSchema;
  handler: (params: any) => Promise<any>;
}
```

기존 McpMessage 인터페이스를 확장하여 자동화 관련 메시지 타입 추가

기존 useUpbitStore.ts 패턴을 따라 구현:

```typescript
// app/store/useMCPAutomationStore.ts
interface MCPAutomationStore {
  // State
  analyses: Record<string, CodeAnalysisResult>;
  workflows: AutomationWorkflow[];
  currentWorkflow: string | null;

  // Actions
  addAnalysis: (analysis: CodeAnalysisResult) => void;
  updateWorkflow: (id: string, updates: Partial<AutomationWorkflow>) => void;
  startWorkflow: (workflow: AutomationWorkflow) => void;
}
```

Zustand의 persist 미들웨어를 사용하여 상태 영속화

